    {
      "body": "Reopening this as a new PR, since GitHub will not reopen a PR whose branch was force-pushed.\n\n@mgoin — reworking this per your review on #57739 (\"This detail doesn't belong in the general docs\").\n\nThe note is now in the Apple Silicon tab of the CPU installation page (`docs/getting_started/installation/cpu.apple.inc.md`), right after the vLLM-Metal tip, and the quickstart change is dropped entirely — the general docs are untouched.\n\nOne note on the broader picture: #50165 was closed as not planned in favour of #62747, which swaps `facebook/opt-125m` for `Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B` across the doc examples and fixes the general case. This PR does not touch any of the pages #62747 changes, so it should not conflict with it. What it adds is the remaining bit: the Apple Silicon install page itself still does not say that the model needs to ship safetensors for MLX to load it.\n\nIf you would rather not have a separate note at all and consider the gap covered by #62747, just say so and I will close this again.",
